text  305,79   Effects animate the playfield and the notes: keyframes move things over time, nodes react to
text  305,89   the beat and to how the player plays.
text  305,101  They only exist in this client. Making a .tko saves a copy next to your .osu and leaves the
text  306,111  .osu exactly as it is, so it still plays the same in osu!stable.
